{
  "question_type": "single_choice",
  "stem_md": "方程 $\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{3x^2+y^2-6x+3}{2xy-2y}$ 的通解为（ ）",
  "options_json": [
    {
      "key": "opt_1",
      "content_md": "$(x-y)^2+xy+x^3=C$"
    },
    {
      "key": "opt_2",
      "content_md": "$(x-1)^2+y^2+2xy=C$"
    },
    {
      "key": "opt_3",
      "content_md": "$x^3+y^3-2xy=C$"
    },
    {
      "key": "opt_4",
      "content_md": "$3(x-1)^2-y^2=C(x-1)$"
    }
  ],
  "answer_json": {
    "option_keys": [
      "opt_4"
    ]
  },
  "analysis_md": "$\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{3(x-1)^2+y^2}{2(x-1)y}$，设 $X=x-1,$\n\n则 $\\frac{dy}{dX}=\\frac{3X^2+y^2}{2Xy}$，设 $\\frac{y}{X}=u,\\quad\\frac{dy}{dX}=u+X\\frac{du}{dX}$，代入得\n\n$\\frac{u}{3-u^2}\\,du=\\frac{1}{2X}\\,dX,$ 积分得\n\n$-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(3-u^2)=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln X+\\frac{1}{2}\\ln C,$\n\n$(3-u^2)X+C=0,$\n\n$3(x-1)^2-y^2=C(x-1).$",
  "search_text": "方程 $\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{3x^2+y^2-6x+3}{2xy-2y}$ 的通解为（ ） $(x-y)^2+xy+x^3=C$ $(x-1)^2+y^2+2xy=C$ $x^3+y^3-2xy=C$ $3(x-1)^2-y^2=C(x-1)$ $\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{3(x-1)^2+y^2}{2(x-1)y}$，设 $X=x-1,$\n\n则 $\\frac{dy}{dX}=\\frac{3X^2+y^2}{2Xy}$，设 $\\frac{y}{X}=u,\\quad\\frac{dy}{dX}=u+X\\frac{du}{dX}$，代入得\n\n$\\frac{u}{3-u^2}\\,du=\\frac{1}{2X}\\,dX,$ 积分得\n\n$-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(3-u^2)=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln X+\\frac{1}{2}\\ln C,$\n\n$(3-u^2)X+C=0,$\n\n$3(x-1)^2-y^2=C(x-1).$",
  "sort_order": 6
}
